{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "1b4abef1f824ec0693d58310584fcb9bd40f85dfb8e997185af903169138a61d", "ja": "プラリネ", "zh": "Praline", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5a194e78d392201f6e8b2e4f2ec01155c4f848d4360260730e8c35497e32d730", "ja": "翼を知ろうとトコトン付き合うことにした\nジュリアは、翼の幼さと、それ故の純粋で\n自由で煌めくような才能に触れる。その後\n通りかかった静香と未来は、心から路上ライ\nブを楽しむ二人と出会うのだった。", "zh": "决定彻底陪着翼，去了解她\n茱莉亚接触到了翼的稚气，以及正因如此而拥有的纯真、\n自由又闪耀的才能。之后，路过的静香和未来\n遇见了发自内心享受着街头演出的两个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1000_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d0110cd2bcfb9df48e1fd197e3f6cda812a7aa0612f52a20927875c15e3ad063", "ja": "えへ。ジュリアーノとお出かけするの初めてかも！", "zh": "嘿嘿。和茱莉亚一起出门，这还是第一次呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "5c4d0eed05f1d6a2ac6eddd1283736efb9761836d48303e1a3839eee81fffc3d", "ja": "いや、お出かけっつーか……。\nえっと、翼はどっかあるのか？　行きたい所。", "zh": "不，这算不上是出门……  \n那个，翼有没有什么想去的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4db94c9093cdda6d56cbca646865b3caca96d0fff99a8c91283cc2218df066a7", "ja": "えっ！　わたしが決めていいんですかぁ～！？\nそれじゃあー……。", "zh": "诶！让我来决定也可以吗～！？\n那就——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "dd77d48867731d1e828de5d11cf3e4166592ad47c7a378632410382dfe6e8e43", "ja": "翼はこの店、よく来るのか？", "zh": "翼经常来这家店吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "86bd8ea2e31e41e729ecb7198c0a8247daa64b87297c01096982fb29411db7fb", "ja": "うん！　美希先輩が、ここの服好きって言ってたから！\nほら、雑誌で着てたスカート！", "zh": "嗯！因为美希前辈说她喜欢这家店的衣服！\n你看，就是她在杂志上穿过的那条裙子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4f996262b4caacfa2c9dd56740cb8ee7ff76cd6b897c45bf00cc3045b6c8db53", "ja": "先輩がブルーだったから、わたしピンクにしよっと。\nあ、これ！　ジュリアーノに似合いそう！", "zh": "因为前辈选了蓝色，那我就选粉色吧。\n啊，这件！感觉很适合茱莉亚呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "baf60cb9963d2504fa587de12c0d67537098fd2cbb3346c161986af0d5bdfef3", "ja": "……はぁ！？　着れるわけないだろ、そんなフリフリ！\nムリムリムリムリ！", "zh": "……哈啊！？我怎么可能穿得下那种全是花边的衣服啊！\n不行不行不行不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "33ec2faaf02a2976e07a9ac740b5ffa83db8e7104c8048c005423e826286f771", "ja": "ジュリアーノもたまにはスカート履けばいいのに。", "zh": "要是茱莉亚也偶尔穿穿裙子就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "ca01364428c1a20f4e19cfac22378cd3615349a3c0c9aa3127d075e2bff3c998", "ja": "そーゆうのは似合うヤツが着ればいいの。\nあたしにはあたしの好みがあるんだからな。", "zh": "那种东西还是让适合的人穿吧。\n我也有我自己的喜好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "588ac8cbae856c5e84a4b0787549ee84d0639b1f4f4c7d4b3cb760fb70f77ec3", "ja": "……。ねえ、ジュリアーノ？\nジュリアーノって、何でアイドルやってるの？", "zh": "……呐，茱莉亚——？  \n茱莉亚，你为什么要当偶像啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "60b59a58b0e9afe3dbb6f8209c46899292bf85b7b780e5a3bad7e4642b7e85e9", "ja": "……。実は……よくわからないんだ。成り行きで\n始めて、何かと理由つけて続けちゃいるけど……。", "zh": "……。其实……我自己也不是很清楚。只是顺水推舟\n就开始了，虽然找着各种理由一直坚持到现在……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "8fc5dea9a5c3978d8622e2a8add67edf446cefe4023085e5cb9730c0e30cde0a", "ja": "皆ほど、アイドルにもなりきれない。\nスカート履いてダンスってのも、苦手だしさ。", "zh": "我也没法像大家那样，彻底成为偶像。\n穿着裙子跳舞什么的，我也不太擅长啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "56255c2c38c95a0cbe9317199b257a47f78af4a9b91ad613594d13371ca4209f", "ja": "わたしはスカートも絶対似合うって思いますけどー。\nきっと何着ても、ステージに立てば……。", "zh": "我觉得穿裙子也绝对很适合你呀——\n只要站上舞台，肯定穿什么都……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4f06c463f7698752f4cb6e3dbc5e242ca06ac0bb3579ebab0e20287b6a85f26c", "ja": "いつものジュリアーノだよ。\n会場をぐるっと見渡してから、こうニッて笑うの。", "zh": "就是平时的茱莉亚哦。\n把整个会场扫视一圈之后，像这样咧嘴一笑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "58d076f774dbf18cd8f48206183749be946e3cddc9ca8ab015409104ece9743f", "ja": "（……。翼のヤツ、あたしのそんなところ見てたのか）", "zh": "（……翼那家伙，原来一直在看我那一面吗）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "c099f1a2b946860af0d4f77b16b1de1855f5de1f5952d5a57984bfd6cfbc49f7", "ja": "……よし！　次はどこ行くんだ！？\n今日はトコトン翼に付き合ってやるぜ！", "zh": "……好！接下来要去哪儿啊！？\n今天我就奉陪翼到底啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "98b9e2fe984621f607bffa4355b29d56f3de08900881a96fcc7f274eab35ee9d", "ja": "本当～！？　ジュリアーノだいすき！", "zh": "真的～！？最喜欢茱莉亚了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "4484bd9943b136d123546d5244c84c0e112cc398c54d5d19791594aa6cf77219", "ja": "（その後、あたしは本当にトコトン翼に付き合った。\nゲーセンにオモチャ屋にペットショップに、まあ色々）", "zh": "（之后……我真的陪翼玩了个彻底。游戏厅、玩具店、宠物店，还有嘛，各种地方）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1019_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "39971eb86455daf42cc263c2632f7d5bc8d130eddd6bf9b122007a14601cb38d", "ja": "えへ。このスカート履いたら、\n美希先輩に一歩近づけるかな♪", "zh": "嘿嘿。穿上这条裙子的话，\n就能离美希前辈更近一步了吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "235264017d9396b9a641716dacb7be9c3cb2bbc9f548b70fd2623760d6104513", "ja": "翼はホントに美希が好きなんだな。\nオーディションのダンスもだから頑張ったんだろ？", "zh": "翼是真的很喜欢美希啊。试镜时的舞蹈，你也是因为这个才努力的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "21f53eba22c980018cb7cb7e4d49c2e00ab368248a0bdf721a3597cd5a5b9249", "ja": "……。……うん。", "zh": "……。……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "b6d6462db035c51b4efa8a9b0a022559bd772096a3f3bb3804c01421fa09f734", "ja": "何だ？　落ちたこと気にしてんのか？　大事なのは\n他人の評価より、自分が納得出来るかどうかだぜ。", "zh": "怎么了？还在介意落选的事吗？重要的是，比起他人的评价，自己是否能够接受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7e42e79161e1f89d58bffce1a24b66216ab6156bcb1001ca044add375c29a512", "ja": "だってわたし、美希先輩みたいなアイドルになりたいん\nだもん。だから先輩に駄目って言われたら、悲しいよ。", "zh": "因为我想成为像美希前辈那样的偶像嘛。\n所以要是前辈说我不行，我会很难过的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "cf42a0c45e88f82e15e75e09c8a43ab65471943214c1e315393526c83982c537", "ja": "なあ翼……。あたしの歌はあたしだけのものだ。\nあたしにしか作れない。", "zh": "喂，翼……我的歌只属于我自己。只有我才能创作出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "8c4ddd5c4434e7109efd7e65fa39092abdb96f164789484b6ec00d72a8779fe7", "ja": "アイドルだって同じじゃないか？　例えお揃いの服を\n着たって、オマエは決して美希にはなれないんだぜ。", "zh": "偶像不也是一样吗？就算穿着一模一样的衣服，\n你也绝对不可能变成美希啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c51b3618f879d5cca9bf06663e9c10a6c47bc7c30cffb3f14fd5fa6e2961e49e", "ja": "……。ジュリアーノってば、\nそんなの当たり前じゃないですかぁ～。", "zh": "……。茱莉亚也真是的，\n那种事不是理所当然的嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e5704ea0e2b01a91a7be4c6d3069c597fde145a74a6d8b4c24efef20691c2ed5", "ja": "美希先輩はお手本ですけど。声も顔も違うのに先輩本人\nにはなれないですよぉ～。わたしはわたしだもん。", "zh": "美希前辈是我的榜样，可是……声音和长相都不一样，我不可能变成前辈本人的啦～我就是我嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "54fd87e94a6840bcd46682ddc1365ebf4ab4993d83fb3222b3fa731ec697415e", "ja": "だから頑張ってダンスとか真似して、それでいつか\nわたしもトップアイドルになりたいなって。", "zh": "所以我想努力模仿舞蹈之类的，然后有一天，我也想成为顶级偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f88a2b0b04d93270a847e74f614ac77cb3e49fd94e30e57a0ca972593595e736", "ja": "そうしたら毎日、苦労も悩みもなくて\nモテモテで……キラキラで……。", "zh": "那样的话，每天都没有辛苦和烦恼，受人欢迎……闪闪发光……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a3019187cee89436e40f58af4ef73b9eac8ba91503abf233c3e57df813afe3c2", "ja": "きっと……そこにあるのは、最高の人生だって\n思うんです。それが、わたしの夢。", "zh": "我觉得……那一定是最棒的人生。\n那就是，我的梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "df471edbd7317b25a99f1170f54d6cf3245b33d4a2bf89b882394edea12d959d", "ja": "（くだらない夢だ）", "zh": "（真是个无聊的梦想）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1036_050jul", "source_sha256": "073fa1f3dfa4d26e8c6fda4ffd30d7a3d7a121f0b925262cf18deab6f6260b53", "ja": "（トップアイドルだって、苦労や悩みがないわけがない\n……翼の思い描く楽しいだけの未来は、そこにない）", "zh": "（就算是顶级偶像，也不可能没有辛苦和烦恼……翼所描绘的那种只有快乐的未来，并不存在。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1037_050jul", "source_sha256": "ffdd3d9789972809c6e85c0efb892aee9cd3fbed28362c991bca3d73cfd7f0ed", "ja": "（誰だって知っている。アイドルは夢だけでは\n語れない。人真似だけでトップに立てる世界じゃない）", "zh": "（谁都知道。偶像不是只靠梦想就能说清楚的。也不是光学别人就能登上顶峰的世界）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1038_050jul", "source_sha256": "a336b8bfe553b9bfe8ab2c76130eecaa4682ad9f74c4f5dbaf52d279c7e38bfa", "ja": "（ああ……だけど……。きれいな瞳だな……）", "zh": "（啊……可是……她的眼睛真漂亮啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1039_050jul", "source_sha256": "e00cd2c858989f9f26ed6ef9860eb413e396cbc9ebb9223e095ae8d3f4617291", "ja": "（ただ、未来に夢を見る……14歳の女の子の瞳だ）", "zh": "（只是，那是一个会在未来憧憬梦想的14岁女孩的眼睛）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1040_050jul", "source_sha256": "57ba182238e4be2a4b9037cca4e7ff3f1f7fd45a5d538d64a9bb41464e538d75", "ja": "ヨシ、翼！　そろそろ今日のシメといくか！", "zh": "好，翼！差不多该为今天收尾了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1041_016tsu", "source_sha256": "29f73249a8e5cc959beae6dbdf1858a9f07135d2b23f489756ed084a72ffaab6", "ja": "どこ行きますー？\nわたし、カラオケでパーッと歌いたいな！", "zh": "我们要去哪儿～？\n我想去KTV痛痛快快地唱一场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1042_050jul", "source_sha256": "5fd7beb4961e6075374d36e81ac6263b23438d25992fcc45dfaec22de1f1a0a3", "ja": "そう言うと思ったぜ。……あたしについて来な。\nカラオケよりハマるアソビを教えてやるよ。", "zh": "我就知道你会这么说。……跟我来。\n我带你去玩比卡拉OK更带劲的游戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1043_050jul", "source_sha256": "5b23620c430c89737b9c73679bd63d084a78a193dc2e16e267736af33be6eb20", "ja": "（そう言って、あたしが翼を誘ったのは……）", "zh": "（说着这些，我邀请翼一起去的地方是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1044_014mir", "source_sha256": "ad0df1ced1ad6dd6856e29f1745c2e83a09aa47d24e1270c0dceff8c47944186", "ja": "静香ちゃーん！", "zh": "静香——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1045_015siz", "source_sha256": "56b016981c41aaeffcf4818f4c2e09b1d6615a160edc909d729223721d95ce9a", "ja": "未来。今帰り？", "zh": "未来。刚要回去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1046_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b68731943df7964e5dda9c579ac2538a9ab233b626a5e4a94d165b2a840f6125", "ja": "イエ～イ♪", "zh": "耶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1047_015siz", "source_sha256": "f10be23dc2b48d3ff57f84b4df05b73b9ba881c37f22ea45c7df3b67b7dfb147", "ja": "しっ！　待って、この声……！", "zh": "嘘！等等，这个声音……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1048_050jul", "source_sha256": "09381db70d870f5bcde57d16b43c52571929e88150cdb4e2de13f70f1b6776a0", "ja": "（翼を誘ったのは、あたしのギターに合わせて\n翼が歌う、路上ライブだった）", "zh": "（邀请翼，是因为她会配合我的吉他唱歌的街头演出。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1049_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ebb8f26bf74002304b2fede9a3da5644b3e19f485629eb34bb690235acb8e40d", "ja": "まだまだ行くよ～！", "zh": "还要继续唱哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1050_050jul", "source_sha256": "b64a904f92f51f635bdc4e92044ef8408bf0688992610cf4ec8eabb88f484c4f", "ja": "（翼のヤツ、気持ち良さそうに歌うんだな。優しく\nリードしてやれば、無邪気に後ろを付いて来る）", "zh": "（翼那家伙，唱得很舒服自在嘛。只要温柔地引导她，她就会天真地跟在后面。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1051_050jul", "source_sha256": "788d25df9b74efaaff8da1c230ba87e63dd75a3f3029587095f9cb9475300efb", "ja": "（まるで広い空に放すほどに……\nそれだけ高く飛んでゆくみたいだ）", "zh": "（简直就像把她放飞到广阔的天空中……她也会因此飞得更高。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1052_050jul", "source_sha256": "3c0666719020e53c5f95ba7637da8d385995080fd93327959586876862eded2a", "ja": "よしっと。悪いな、片付けまで手伝わせちゃって。\nそれじゃあ二人とも、気を付けて帰れよ。", "zh": "好嘞。不好意思啊，还让你们帮忙收拾。\n那你们两个回去路上小心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1053_014mir", "source_sha256": "678749145c61ac8e6e8943c405958d3c7618ef5b6de2f225370f9975dbc825e4", "ja": "あれ？　ジュリアさんたちは……？", "zh": "咦？茱莉亚你们不回去吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0343_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0343_story_04_1054_050jul", "source_sha256": "7e475dcb6f47d17c6261154c8ef37429636d2b93228e781a1396ccd586d26311", "ja": "ウチらはちょっとシアターに戻るよ。\n明日のライブ……嵐が起きるぜ。", "zh": "我们先回剧场一趟。\n明天的演唱会……会掀起一场风暴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
